  "bio": "Renowned for his illustrative prowess, Phil Vonsin is a celebrated tattoo artist based out of Manchester, United Kingdom. Operating from Sin City Studio in Stockport, his attention to cleanliness is exemplary, ensuring a safe and sterile environment for each of his clients. Phil's artwork not only captures the essence of his clients' visions but is executed in a spotless setting, reflecting his utmost professionalism in the sphere of tattooing.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Manchester, England, United Kingdom"
